# thirteen vendored CMS fixtures on the first attempt at the same pattern.
src/lib/forms/__fixtures__/forms-backend-v1/

# CFM fitment datasets delivered verbatim. A dataset carries two hashes: the SEMANTIC
# datasetHash, which is computed over a canonical form and so survives reformatting, and
# the TRANSPORT SHA-256 of the exact delivered bytes, which does not. Prettier ran over
# pilot-sample.json on its first commit and changed three lines; that one happened to be
# harmless because only the semantic hash is recorded for it. The real pilot, whose exact
# bytes CFM reports and we verify, would be silently broken by the same edit.
src/lib/fitment/fixtures/

